   "text": "No recommendation for fair wall-clock comparison against solvers.",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q1.22",
   "reviewer": "Q1",
   "text": "Mainly engineering/data contribution with little ML content; poor ICLR fit.",
   "minor": false
  },
  {
   "id": "Q1.23",
   "reviewer": "Q1",
   "text": "Typos and loosely worded sentences.",
